\pard\b\fs20 Grand Settling Feast\b0\par
\fs16\par
The first huts are built and the clonks raise their shovels. The ground smells of coal, sulfur, ore and GOLD! The first elevators break their shafts through the stony surface, and the settling feast begins.\par
Every clan is sure to be the first to reach the required settlement points and clunkers.\par
Peacefully, the clans dig side by side for the treasures in the ground. But over time more and more accidents happen in the mines, and many a well-filled lorry disappears. So what is wrong with simply being well prepared?\par
}
